of a controller. One can simply push the arm forward to release a fireball, or snap the fingers to trigger an arcanic flame that seeks nearby enemies.\n\nWe also introduce a new way to move across vast terrain. By using one's own body to induce movement, the player feels more immersed and less prone to VR sickness. You can now easily strafe to dodge incoming missiles, while firing with both hands at different directions.\n\n", "short_description": "Experience fast-paced action in VR without a controller! Dodge bullet, dodge bullet in mid-air, shoot fireballs or facepalm an robot. Immerse yourself in an anime world and obliterate your foes in the most intuitive way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://madturtle84.github.io/sbr.static/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Art Zero", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/SBRxVR", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_TW"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9093550014029796"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974582_575544448303930_9134053264264701844_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nh8UC1jC6x8Q7kNvwEM-bui&_nc_oc=AdpMS4Dyi4mfZapDjte9FvAXDOdbDDfdVbu2NvJvu2izQUjLyIfURjVtWPvoAJJnNqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scon